cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "T2T-eQTL-capstone: does the reference genome change eQTLs? T2T-CHM13 vs GRCh38 in MAGE"
abstract: >-
  RNA-seq of 731 MAGE lymphoblastoid cell lines and their 1000 Genomes genotypes, processed from the same raw reads on
  T2T-CHM13v2.0 and GRCh38, to find which cis-eQTLs change with the reference genome. A Nextflow pipeline runs the
  full analysis on a cluster; `pixi run reproduce` reruns the paired test, the changed-gene sets, the figures and the
  report from the published processed data.
authors:
